#. Settings
msgctxt "allow_local_connections"
msgid "Allow local connections"
msgstr "Lokale Verbindungen zulassen"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "allow_provider_cell_network_unlimited_plan"
msgid "You can also allow the provider to use cell network data, which works great if you have an unlimited plan."
msgstr "Du kannst dem Anbieter auch erlauben, Mobilfunkdaten zu verwenden – das funktioniert super, wenn du eine unbegrenzte Datenflat hast."

#. Call to action
msgctxt "allow_providing_cell"
msgid "Allow providing on cellular network"
